\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.2}{\ignorespaces Architecture overview of the deterministic model. The model fuses a custom windowed Space-then-Time attention backbone into a U-net style encoder-decoder structure. The architecture employs a high amount of skip and residual connections to create complex modelling posibilities, while retaining stable training dynamics. The model architecture is designed to ensure rich spatial and temporal feature extraction and processing, answering the stated challenges on generalisation, temporal stability and efficiency.}}{27}{figure.caption.34}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:det_model_architecture}{{5.2}{27}{Architecture overview of the deterministic model. The model fuses a custom windowed Space-then-Time attention backbone into a U-net style encoder-decoder structure. The architecture employs a high amount of skip and residual connections to create complex modelling posibilities, while retaining stable training dynamics. The model architecture is designed to ensure rich spatial and temporal feature extraction and processing, answering the stated challenges on generalisation, temporal stability and efficiency}{figure.caption.34}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5.1}{\ignorespaces Hyperparameters for deterministic FluidGPT models.}}{27}{table.caption.35}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:fluidgpt_hparams_det}{{5.1}{27}{Hyperparameters for deterministic FluidGPT models}{table.caption.35}{}}
